        "metadata": {
          "description": "Identity and container facts. `format` and `schema_version` are the format's own declaration — empty on every record written before 2026-09-10, non-empty on everything written since. `analyzer_version` is the discriminator this format had BEFORE those two AND the cache key — `sidecar.rs::read_sidecar` re-analyzes any sidecar whose version differs from the running binary, which is why a widened record invalidates the corpus automatically. `analysis_depth` is \"full\" or \"preview_only\"; absent on the 120 records written before it existed, and absent MEANS full.",
